        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions OZK1RDDSBR, Reeded Brass Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFeaturing the classic ribbon and reed design, First Impression's Ozark Door Pull is available in a huge selection of finishes from classic polished brass to a more modern satin chrome. Choose from 8 inch or 16 inch lengths. The Ozark Ribbon and Reed Door Pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions OZK1RDDSBR 1 Diameter Ribbon and Reeded Grip Brass Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-OZK01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262336\"><b>First Impressions OZK1RDDSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>OZK1008RDDSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>OZK1016RDDSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1.61\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2.61\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 7 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the pull, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
