                "title": "Ozark Ribbon and Reed Door Pull",
                "description": "Featuring the classic ribbon and reed design, First Impression's Ozark Door Pull is available in a huge selection of finishes from classic polished brass to a more modern satin chrome. Choose from 8 inch or 16 inch lengths. The Ozark Ribbon and Reed Door Pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted.",
